  Both defects are visible here in one run:
    - runtimes per sample {0: 1, 1: 310, 2: 32}: 32 samples carry TWO runtimes,
      the neuron-profile capture running beside the harness's own runtime. The
      second entry per sample is not hypothetical on this suite's own runs.
    - execution_active_periods 36 against execution_block_periods 33: an isolated
      setup execution (the lone "1" at sample 14, zeros either side) sits outside
      the loop's block. First-to-last would have started there.
